#: ../../api/types/input_rich_block_thinking.rst:3
msgid "InputRichBlockThinking"
msgstr "InputRichBlockThinking"

#: litegram.types.input_rich_block_thinking.InputRichBlockThinking:1 of
msgid ""
"A block with a 'Thinking…' placeholder, corresponding to the custom HTML "
"tag :code:`<tg-thinking>`. The block may be used only in "
":class:`litegram.methods.send_rich_message_draft.SendRichMessageDraft`, "
"therefore it can't be received in messages. See "
"``https://t.me/addemoji/AIActions <https://t.me/addemoji/AIActions>`_ "
"<https://t.me/addemoji/AIActions>`_ for examples of custom emoji that are"
" recommended for usage in the block."
msgstr ""
"Блок с заглушкой «Думаю…»; соответствует пользовательскому HTML-тегу "
":code:`<tg-thinking>`. Блок можно использовать только в "
":class:`litegram.methods.send_rich_message_draft.SendRichMessageDraft`, "
"поэтому в полученных сообщениях он не встречается. Примеры "
"пользовательских эмодзи, рекомендуемых для этого блока: "
"``https://t.me/addemoji/AIActions <https://t.me/addemoji/AIActions>`_ "
"<https://t.me/addemoji/AIActions>`_."

#: litegram.types.input_rich_block_thinking.InputRichBlockThinking:3 of
msgid "Source: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#inputrichblockthinking"
msgstr "Источник: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#inputrichblockthinking"

#: litegram.types.input_rich_block_thinking.InputRichBlockThinking.type:1 of
msgid "Type of the block, always 'thinking'"
msgstr "Тип блока, всегда 'thinking'"

#: litegram.types.input_rich_block_thinking.InputRichBlockThinking.text:1 of
msgid ""
"Text of the block. See ``https://t.me/addemoji/AIActions "
"<https://t.me/addemoji/AIActions>`_ <https://t.me/addemoji/AIActions>`_ "
"for examples of custom emoji that are recommended for usage in the block."
msgstr ""
"Текст блока. Примеры пользовательских эмодзи, рекомендуемых для этого "
"блока: ``https://t.me/addemoji/AIActions "
"<https://t.me/addemoji/AIActions>`_ <https://t.me/addemoji/AIActions>`_."

